#!markdown

# The one-cell setup, reference first

The guide's first cell, with the extension and the library pinned to the version under test. The
second cell's figure must be drawn by the extension that cell loaded.

#!fsharp

#r "nuget: Marey, @VERSION@"
#!extension Marey.Verso @VERSION@

open Marey
open Marey.UnitsOfMeasure

#!fsharp

let t = Q.init U.second 41 (fun i -> float i * 0.05<s>)
Chart.lineIn U.second U.metre t (t |> Seq.map (fun ti -> 0.1<m> * cos (2.0 * System.Math.PI * float ti)))
